# @nethix-desktop — baseline desktop package set (skeleton, tier-1 only)
#
# Rule: only atoms verified to exist in ::gentoo / ::guru land here.
# Grow incrementally; run `emerge -p @nethix-desktop` after each addition.
# Packages with unclear names stay OUT until verified with `emerge -s`.
#
# Consumed by: emerge @nethix-desktop  (inside the ISO build chroot,
# with FEATURES=buildpkg — every package lands in the binhost).

# --- CLI / shell niceties ---
app-misc/fastfetch
app-shells/starship
app-shells/zoxide
app-misc/ripgrep
app-editors/vim
app-editors/micro
app-misc/magic-wormhole

# --- filesystems / disks ---
